---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Resume — Chris Schmidt"
  description="Resume of Chris Schmidt, Machine Learning Engineer and JHU AI Engineering MS student."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="section-title">Resume</h1>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Five years of experience across data engineering, software development, and ML engineering at HII Mission Technologies. Currently supporting DoD data modernization programs with an active security clearance, and pursuing an MS in AI Engineering at Johns Hopkins University.
      </p>

      <div class="resume-actions">
        <a
          href="/resume/ChrisSchmidt_Resume_10_9_26.pdf"
          class="btn btn-primary"
          download
        >
          ↓ Download PDF
        </a>
        <a
          href="/resume/ChrisSchmidt_Resume_10_9_26.pdf"
          class="btn btn-outline"
        >
          Open in Browser ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="resume-preview-wrap">
        <iframe
          src="/resume/ChrisSchmidt_Resume_10_9_26.pdf"
          title="Chris Schmidt Resume"
          class="resume-embed"
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
        <p class="resume-fallback">
          Can't see the PDF?{' '}
          <a href="/resume/ChrisSchmidt_Resume_10_9_26.pdf">
            Click here to open it directly
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="exp-section">
        <h2 class="exp-section-title">Work Experience</h2>

        <div class="exp-entry">
          <div class="exp-header">
            <span class="exp-company">HII Mission Technologies</span>
            <span class="exp-role-dates">Machine Learning Engineer, F-35 Joint Program Office | Oct 2024 – present</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="exp-bullets">
            <li>Lead analytics for the F-35 JPO data modernization initiative, building Python analysis tools and Power BI dashboards on AWS GovCloud.</li>
            <li>Perform enterprise-scale data architecture analysis to support DoD audit-readiness.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="exp-entry">
          <div class="exp-header">
            <span class="exp-company">HII Mission Technologies</span>
            <span class="exp-role-dates">Software Engineer | May 2022 – Oct 2024</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="exp-bullets">
            <li>Led data analysis and data quality work for DoD data modernization on the Advana platform (Databricks, Qlik Sense), working with MILDEP and IA subject-matter experts.</li>
            <li>Built data pipelines and APIs for the Fortis AI program in Python and SQL, plus exploratory tooling using OCR, translation, geospatial, and graph (Cypher, SPARQL, RDF) methods.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="exp-entry">
          <div class="exp-header">
            <span class="exp-company">HII Mission Technologies</span>
            <span class="exp-role-dates">Data Engineer, Associate | Jul 2021 – May 2022</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="exp-bullets">
            <li>Built serverless ETL on AWS (Lambda, Kinesis, SQS, S3, DynamoDB, Elasticsearch) ingesting up to 1 million text documents per hour for Fortis AI.</li>
            <li>Integrated BERT-based NLP models and authored technical documentation.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="exp-section">
        <h2 class="exp-section-title">Education</h2>

        <div class="exp-entry">
          <div class="exp-header">
            <span class="exp-company">Johns Hopkins University</span>
            <span class="exp-role-dates">MS, AI Engineering | 2025 – May 2029 (expected)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exp-entry">
          <div class="exp-header">
            <span class="exp-company">Towson University</span>
            <span class="exp-role-dates">MS, Applied Mathematics | 2019 – 2021</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .resume-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .resume-preview-wrap {
    background: #f3f4f6;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .resume-embed {
    width: 100%;
    height: 720px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: white;
  }

  .resume-fallback {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .exp-section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .exp-section-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .exp-entry {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .exp-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .exp-company {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .exp-role-dates {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .exp-bullets {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .exp-bullets li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #374151;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .exp-bullets li::before {
    content: '\203A';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #1e40af;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .resume-embed {
      height: 480px;
    }
  }
</style>
